{
  "batch": "admissions-batch-3",
  "note": "Third batch: the paper registry for mastery/DESIGN-ADMISSIONS.md (build order step 1). STEP: OCR's Explanation of results PDFs 2019 to 2026 (linked from the scoring-and-results page) and OCR's per-year past paper zips 2019 to 2025 (linked from Preparing for STEP; each zip holds the STEP 2 and STEP 3 question papers and the examiners' report with mark scheme). Kind \"zip\" is saved with the .bin extension by fetch.mjs; unzip it in sources/ to read. No 2026 STEP papers are linked from OCR yet. TMUA: every 2016 to 2023 paper, worked answers and answer key linked from the UAT-UK preparation materials page. A level: Edexcel 9MA0 and 9FM0 June 2024 and June 2025 papers and mark schemes, found through Pearson's past paper search (a JavaScript page, so it is not fetched); June 2026 is locked to teachers for nine months. Pearson boundaries are the GCE subject and notional component documents; the 9MA0 and 9FM0 specifications (linked from the course page) give the paper timings, since the 9MA0 Paper 3 booklets (31 and 32) print none. OCR H446 June 2024 and June 2025 papers and mark schemes (June 2026 not yet public) and OCR's AS and A Level boundary documents for those series.",
